<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia's Evermaster debuts at 15 rgt.</title>
<headline>Malaysia's Evermaster debuts at 15 rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Evermaster Group Bhd made their debut on the stock market at 15 ringgit against an offer price of seven.</p>
<p>The timber products trading group offered five million shares in its initial public offering.  </p>
<p>After five minutes, the stock was at 15.40 ringgit, after trading between 15.0 and 15.70. Volume was 575,000 shares.</p>
<p>Evermaster forecast net profit of 6.23 million ringgit, or earnings per share of 31.2 cents for the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
</text>
